### HOTELS API
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/hotels/
Accept: application/json

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/hotels/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "hotel_name": "Grand Palace Hotel",
    "location": "Thiruvalla",
    "address": "MC Road, Thiruvalla, Kerala",
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "email": "grandpalace@gmail.com",
    "rating": 4.5
}

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/hotels/1/
Accept: application/json


### ROOMS API
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/rooms/
Accept: application/json

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/rooms/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "hotel": 1,
    "room_number": "101",
    "room_type": "Deluxe",
    "price_per_night": 2500,
    "capacity": 2,
    "available": true
}

### 
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/rooms/1/
Accept: application/json



### CUSTOMERS API
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers/
Accept: application/json

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_name": "Anjali Menon",
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "email": "anjali@gmail.com",
    "age": 25
}

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers/1/
Accept: application/json



